RIMBind Web, pre-release development workspace.
Original frozen RIMBind model and pipeline source snapshots are copied from the
study's audited public-release candidate, under Apache License 2.0.

The model-C loader changes only import-time dependency handling in an execution
AST. Frozen source bytes and checkpoint tensors are not changed. CPU numerical
acceptance did not pass the preselected 1e-5 tolerance; no full-model web service
has been declared validated.

